        "$id": "9"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "So, you’re the one who saved Kirouac, huh? You’re tougher than I thought. Considering all our old enemies are crawling out of the sand dunes now that the Blue Chamber Collective means war with us, I’m glad someone like you is on our side.",
          "_meta": "Simeon_TendFlame_02"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_unpc_simeon_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "40fbaef3-4bf8-4bc9-bf2f-ae0d25ded760",
        "_position": {
          "x": 3960.0,
          "y": 4080.0
        },
